bluejetty:00157141:ios.description:
Need to Deal with Last-Minute Tasks? Get Nerdify App!
Nerdify App is a very simple tool connecting people who have urgent tasks with expert Nerds ready to help 24/7. From college tasks to market research for your company, from English to Chemistry: there are specialists to cover any request in any field! 
Using Nerdify App is absolutely free. You pay only for the request after confirming the final price!
3 steps to get what you need at Nerdify:
Step 1
Send the task: describe it or just attach a pic/photo with instructions;
Step 2
Get a reply in minutes to confirm we found and assigned a Nerd to you;
Step 3
Get qualified help from your Nerd in the required time frame or asap ;)
Fun facts about Nerdify:
We focus on helping students, businesses and academia;
More than 80 000 satisfied users since 2015;
More than 2000 positive reviews on all review platforms;
The average user rating of Nerds’ performance is 4.7/5.
We created Nerdify App to provide even a better experience for our users! Hope you're gonna love it as much as we do!

